        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Kandih neihlaa kim the, Jisu akhang!",
            "Zianmei riang guay ’tamv the, Jisu akhang!",
            "Dih hei zinghpui bamv de,",
            "zaeng ’thaekcpui bamv maek ge;",
            "Jisu na tiikwn ngam, Jisu akhang!",
            "",
            "2 Abumaengc ta ’thiam rio, Jisu akhang!",
            "Adyng kalaic lak khe, Jisu akhang!",
            "’Maan nuhmei bih pumc hei,",
            "neih khat na khang puanh de,",
            "Akhou >|3 ’tamvlou the, Jisu akhang!",
            "",
            "3 Bam duc tho, theic nuhmei, Jisu akhang!",
            "Riu the, ringcsuangmei >|3, Jisu akhang!",
            "Riu the, zianmei nunc >|3,",
            "riu the, zaengthaek bamv >|3;",
            "Riu the, aKaipouc >|3, Jisu akhang!",
            "",
            "4 Bam duc tho, zingbangc mang, Jisu akhang!",
            "’Muc the, lauthwan pat khou, Jisu akhang!",
            "Ai >|3 machunhmei guay, gaeng makmei sw ngam the;",
            "Jisu na tiipian e, Jisu akhang!"
          ]
        }
      },
